<law>
	<structure>
		<unit label="title" identifier="38.2" level="1">Insurance</unit>
		<unit label="chapter" identifier="45" level="2">Dental or Optometric Services Plans</unit>
	</structure>
	<section_number>38.2-4502</section_number>
	<catch_line>Dental services plans</catch_line>
	<text>
		A group of licensed dentists may conduct through a nonstock corporation as agent for them a dental services plan as defined in § 38.2-4501.
	</text>
	<history>1980, c. 682, § 38.1-892; 1986, c. 562.</history>
</law>
